# IK rig, the two _New material instances — see the note there) go in as plain
# git blobs, NOT LFS. They are ~3MB total; routing them through LFS is what
# would put this repo back under the budget pressure that got Content/Characters
# purged in the first place. Bandwidth on an LFS object is charged per clone,
# and CI clones on every run.
